WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, Serena, you have one of
the best tennis serves

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
on the planet,
but I've been wondering,

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.338 size:84% position:42%
does that also make you
an expert ax thrower?

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, tonight,
we're going to find out,

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:09.743
because I'm challenging you
to an ax-throwing contest.

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:13.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're going to take turns
throwing axes at that target,

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.815
which we found in the old
"Tonight Show" prop room.

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:19.519 size:81% position:41%
10 points for the hat,
5 points for the body,

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:22.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
2 for the legs,
and 1 for the hands.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.456 line:92%
We'll throw three axes each.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
Most points at the end
is the winner.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:28.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll take the first throw.
So maybe stand back.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:32.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Breathes deeply ]
Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:36.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:48.782 line:92%
You slick son of a bitch!

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:52.118 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh!

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:56.389 line:92%
-Oh, yeah, really. Right.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.826 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:02.362 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:08.101 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ahh!

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:15.275 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Geez!

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:18.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, you didn't get him,
but you've killed him.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wow.
All right, here we go.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:25.351 size:88% position:44%
Focus up. You can do it.
You can do it, Jamesy.

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.887 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Here we go!

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:36.262 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Judges?

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:39.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Buzz ]
Yeah, whatever.

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:44.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, my God.
♪♪♪♪

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ]
Happy dance.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:52.779
-You let go at the --
-There you go. Now you got to...

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:55.448 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's scarier
than getting hit with an ax.

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:03.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just bitch-slapped
him with an ax.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:06.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right. Easy-peasy.
Where do you want me to go?

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:09.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Indistinct shouting ]
The hat?

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:11.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, you want me
to go with the hat?

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:15.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
Where do you want me to go?
You want me to go to the body?

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:22.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪♪♪

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:32.185 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah!

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:38.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ]
Yeah!

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:40.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Come on.
You know I took it there.

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:44.864
You can do it for fun, but you
know what's gonna happen. Yeah.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:48.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Man, I loved that
victory dance.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:51.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, here we go.
It's in the release.

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:54.307 line:92%
I don't know how to do this.

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:57.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:57.277 --> 00:03:00.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'll give you the win.
I'll give you the win on that.

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:03.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
Serena Williams, everybody!
-Whoo!

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:04.584 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-The real champ.

